 Test_RefreshStatus_Unauthed←{
⍝ Check the refresh endpoints reject a missing api key with 401.
⍝ ControlAccess rejects before routing, so the POST cannot trigger a refresh.
     Status←{
         h←##.##.##.HttpCommand.New ⍺
         h.URL←⍵
         res←h.Run
         res.HttpStatus
     }
     401≠'POST'Status ⍵,'/admin/refresh':0
     401='GET'Status ⍵,'/admin/refresh/status'
 }
